        "06": "https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Yasser-Al-Dosari/099002.mp3"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "arab": "وَقَالَ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ مَا لَهَا",
      "arab_kemenag": "وَقَالَ الْاِنْسَانُ مَا لَهَاۚ",
      "latin": "Wa qālal-insānu mā lahā.",
      "translation_id": "dan manusia bertanya, “Apa yang terjadi dengannya (bumi)?”",
      "translation_en": "And man says, \"What is [wrong] with it?\" -",
